 {"id":"db-arrow-label","type":"text","x":1620,"y":953,"width":120,"height":30,"text":"상태·결과 ID","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#047857","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"storage","type":"rectangle","x":670,"y":1020,"width":1070,"height":260,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","roughness":1,"strokeWidth":2},
 {"id":"storage-text","type":"text","x":695,"y":1045,"width":1010,"height":210,"text":"PERSISTENCE / preview_dev · SQLAlchemy · 분기별 세션과 commit\n\n자료 묶음: preview_artifacts(record_type=information_bundle) + source snapshots / 원문\n섹션 본문: preview_section_results   [run_id, workflow_id, section_result_id]\n선수 정본: preview_watch_player_sections / preview_injury_player_sections\n번역 후보: preview_player_name_candidates   [PENDING 즉시 사용, 검수와 게시 분리]\n실행 근거: preview_runs / module_executions / attempts / write_audit\n\n홈 선택: failed·cancelled·mock 제외 / 빈 본문·storage_mismatch 차단 / 게시 승인 gate 없음","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.35},
 {"id":"footer","type":"text","x":45,"y":1330,"width":1690,"height":75,"text":"구현 근거: bundle_pipeline.build_bundle_graph · retrieval.collect_with_bodies · retry.RunBudget · home_preview_document\n주의: complete=true는 필수 섹션 기준이다. 5개 섹션 전체 완성 여부는 각각의 상태·본문으로 확인한다.\n제품 017bca2 / 2026.11.19   |   실행 구조 설명용 문서 — 신규 수집·생성·DB 호출 없음","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.4}
 ]
